Package: openadmixturer
Title: Fast ADMIXTURE Estimation on 'tidypopgen' Backing Files
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Andrea", "Manica", email = "am315@cam.ac.uk",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1895-450X"))
Description: An 'R'/'Rcpp' reimplementation of the 'OpenADMIXTURE.jl'
    algorithm (Ko et al. 2023) for estimating individual ancestry proportions
    and population allele frequencies. It combines EM priming, block-wise
    constrained Newton updates solved with an active-set quadratic program,
    and quasi-Newton acceleration. Genotypes are read directly from the
    memory-mapped backing files of 'tidypopgen' 'gen_tibble' objects, and
    results are returned as 'gt_admix' objects.
